# Task 2 – Curriculum Audit

This folder contains the curriculum audit report, credit-change calculator, and supporting evidence.

 Files
- `Curriculum_Audit_Report.docx` — Curriculum audit report.
- `Credit_Change_Calculator.xlsx` — Credit-change calculator.
- `evidence/AI_Exercise_Verification_Log.md` — AI exercise verification log.
- `evidence/AI_USE_AND_CONTRIBUTION.md` — AI-use record and personal contribution.
- `evidence/CREDIT_CALCULATIONS.md` — Credit calculations.
- `evidence/LIMITATIONS.md` — Limitations of the analysis.
- `evidence/SOURCES.md` — Sources consulted.
